flowchart LR
    LHS[(LHS/IA<br/>外存矩阵)]
    RHS[(RHS/W<br/>外存权重)]
    BIAS[(bias 与 per-channel 参数)]
    DST[(DST<br/>int8 输出)]
    DMA[统一块 DMA<br/>二维 burst 读写]
    IAC[IA cache<br/>多个输入矩阵分块]
    KBUF[权重缓存<br/>列向量输出]
    BBUF[bias/quant buffer<br/>输出通道组]
    PE[16x16 脉动阵列<br/>signed multiply accumulate]
    PS[partial sum buffer<br/>int32 累加保存]
    RQ[vec_requant<br/>mult shift zero point clamp]
    OFIFO[输出打包 FIFO<br/>32 bit 数据与 4 bit 写掩码]
    OAW[oa_writer<br/>输出地址生成]

    LHS --> DMA
    RHS --> DMA
    BIAS --> DMA
    DMA --> IAC
    DMA --> KBUF
    DMA --> BBUF
    IAC -->|ia_data_valid| PE
    KBUF -->|store_weight_req weight_data_valid| PE
    BBUF -->|bias_valid quant_valid| PE
    PE -->|acc_valid acc_data| PS
    PS -->|中间和回灌| PE
    PE -->|最终归约 tile| RQ
    RQ -->|s8 valid data| OFIFO
    OFIFO --> OAW
    OAW --> DMA
    DMA --> DST

    classDef mem fill:#EAF7EA,stroke:#3B873E,stroke-width:1px,color:#111;
    classDef dma fill:#FFECEC,stroke:#B64B4B,stroke-width:1px,color:#111;
    classDef cache fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#B88300,stroke-width:1px,color:#111;
    classDef calc fill:#F2ECFF,stroke:#6C43B6,stroke-width:1px,color:#111;
    class LHS,RHS,BIAS,DST mem;
    class DMA,OAW dma;
    class IAC,KBUF,BBUF,PS,OFIFO cache;
    class PE,RQ calc;
